---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="container page-shell">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>Built on real-world problem solving.</h1>
      <p>
        I grew up in a small farming community in Kentucky, where hard work, practical problem-solving, and helping your neighbors ain't just good business strategy, it's just what you do.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="two-col">
      <div class="story-box">
        <h2>My background</h2>
        <p>
            Over the last few decades, I've built a career around solving problems for people with the help of technology. What started in customer-facing support roles, evolved into professional IT services, and eventually led to software engineering work focused on large-scale operations and automation systems.
        </p>
        <p>
            I've spent years supporting users through helpdesk and system admin roles, including Kentucky-based web hosting and publishing companies on through to Amazon. Those experiences taught me that technology problems are rarely just technical problems. They affect people's businesses, schedules, and livelihoods.
        </p>
        <p>
            For the past several years, I've also worked as a Software Development Engineer, building internal tools and systems that support robotics, automation, and computer vision technologies. That experience provides a unique perspective that combines enterprise-level technical expertise with practical hands-on problem solving.
        </p>
        </div>

      <div class="info-box">
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <ul class="timeline">
          <li>10+ years of customer service and client support</li>
          <li>5+ years of professional helpdesk and technical support experience</li>
          <li>2+ years consulting with small businesses on technology planning, deployment, repair, and support</li>
          <li>2+ years as a Software Development Engineer with Amazon working on internal tools, robotics, and computer vision systems</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Approach</span>
        <h2>Technology should serve people, not the other way around.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid features-grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Practical solutions</h3>
          <p>I focus on what actually solves the problem, not what looks good on paper or costs more than it needs to.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Clear communication</h3>
          <p>You’ll get straightforward guidance, realistic timelines, and a clear answer from someone who knows the work firsthand.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3>Long-term value</h3>
          <p>Whether it’s a repair, a custom build, or a hardware install, the goal is dependable performance that lasts.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
